'AI Companion Addiction: How to Help When a Loved One Prefers a Chatbot to Real People',
'Is your loved one addicted to an AI companion or chatbot? Learn the warning signs of AI companion addiction and how families can help them reconnect.',
'Substance Guide',
'https://rizfkjgwhcpwiryyqejx.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/blog-images/ai-companion-addiction-cover.jpg',
